content:
@everyone
There is an ill omen upon the day. Anyone attempting any kind of divination will receive dark tidings.  All mirrors in the town shatter. All portents are 1s.
Dark clouds circle the sky and converge. The moon is blocked from sight. A dark howling wind continues

As the last Hag falls, you all hear the screeching voices of the Hags echo throughout the island. They are chanting:
    Creatures of magic, we make this vow;
    Take back this island, we need you now.
Walk these woods, haunt these shores; 
    Strike all that move, the fight is yours.
    To Roanoke we give this curse;
    It takes effect as we say this verse.
Beware The Hunger, it comes for you.
The terror starts here, that much is true.  
@everyone

@everyone Anyone wanting to run the Sorrow of the Statues, Starting this week there will be an optional side quest. It will have unusual mechanics, so I wanted you all to be aware. You will be playing strangers in the town. Npcs. With commoner stats. If your a caster, take one cantrip. Your gear will be starting gear for your class. You will need to venture into a labyrinth with little else but their wits. Though the danger be deadly, your love ones can rest assured. Don't feel bad for killing some commoners. They are all named chad. Look up the Commoner statblock. Up to 6 people at a time.
Here are the extra tools available. Distribute them amongst your party.
One Healing Potion. One set of 50 ft hemp rope and pitons. One Ladder- 15 foot. One 10 foot pole. One bag of caltrops or ball bearings. or One plus 1 dagger. Pick one of these items per player. Players may not pick the same item.

@everyone after the meteor encounter there will be a baking/culinary competition to prepare for Ozgur's Luau. Slap a 🥐 if you are wanting to be a judge with Percival, slap a 🍳 if you want to register a team of 2-3 to compete.
Baeshra and Goose are on a team by default.

Everyone will get bites at Ozgur's Luau after judging ends

@everyone new channel
Welcome to Chad☆Mart. 

This is a two player minimum role play experience Where chads can sell starting gear to players. The Chad must use dmg prices and no one gets to keep the money.

@everyone since y'all decided to make 1500 goodberries for this fight to exploit the house rule that you can eat more than 1, lol (actually really good thinking so I don't want to completely punish it)
You can feed someone/consume up to a max of  🔟 berries at once using your action.

Stuffing a berry in your mouth is fine, but chewing still requires yours or someone else's action
